I:Parts C, D & E are actually "Roscommon Reel", which was the usual second
I:tune played after "Miss Patterson's" (a/k/a/ "Master Crowley's"). The folks
I:notating the tune evidently didn't know that Doherty was playing two reels
I:and not one. (BB)
